1
00:00:01,581 --> 00:00:04,754
Anna's Metal Breath

2
00:00:11,279 --> 00:00:13,621
I expected this. Looks like you're still coughing.

3
00:00:13,621 --> 00:00:14,945
Could it be a cold?

4
00:00:14,945 --> 00:00:16,309
A cold?

5
00:00:16,309 --> 00:00:18,100
Do Metal Cardbots catch colds too?

6
00:00:18,100 --> 00:00:19,803
Could it be a gremlin pulling a prank?

7
00:00:19,803 --> 00:00:21,254
A gremlin?!

8
00:00:21,254 --> 00:00:23,246
It's a goblin that lived on planet Machina.

9
00:00:23,246 --> 00:00:28,896
If one of those things catches you, it can make your engine stall, and cause your brakes to stop working.

10
00:00:28,896 --> 00:00:31,644
So that's what catching a cold means to you guys.

11
00:00:31,644 --> 00:00:34,746
It's all just superstition! I've never seen any gremlins!

12
00:00:34,746 --> 00:00:37,588
You wouldn't know a gremlin even if it hit you in the face!

13
00:00:37,588 --> 00:00:40,500
How 'bout if I hit a gremlin in the face?!

14
00:00:40,500 --> 00:00:42,296
Achoo!

15
00:00:42,881 --> 00:00:46,116
It's getting cold... let's head back, guys.

16
00:00:46,116 --> 00:00:48,582
You seem a little different today.

17
00:00:48,582 --> 00:00:51,131
Me? I'm the same as ever.

18
00:00:51,131 --> 00:00:53,356
Everyone... take back!

19
00:00:54,128 --> 00:00:57,521
Uncle Edo... please take care of Fleta Z's engine.

20
00:00:57,521 --> 00:01:00,508
I'll try, but planes aren't exactly my specialty.

21
00:01:00,508 --> 00:01:04,140
Oh, come on, Uncle Edo! I know you can do it!

22
00:01:04,140 --> 00:01:06,409
We know you're the best mechanic for the job!

23
00:01:06,409 --> 00:01:07,662
We believe in you!

24
00:01:07,662 --> 00:01:09,429
Haha... I'll try my best.

25
00:01:09,429 --> 00:01:10,462
...Ugh.

26
00:01:12,909 --> 00:01:13,710
What? A cold?

27
00:01:13,710 --> 00:01:15,114
Is Jun alright?

28
00:01:15,114 --> 00:01:16,935
Jun's parents called him out sick.

29
00:01:16,935 --> 00:01:20,304
It's the first time he's missed school for a cold, isn't it?

30
00:01:20,304 --> 00:01:22,265
He seemed fine yesterday...

31
00:01:22,265 --> 00:01:24,615
Could it be...

32
00:01:24,615 --> 00:01:25,793
A gremlin's prank?!

33
00:01:28,596 --> 00:01:32,269
This little troublemaker ate 10 bowls of ice cream at once.

34
00:01:32,269 --> 00:01:36,653
And then he slept with all the windows open and his belly exposed to the cold, and ended up like this.

35
00:01:36,653 --> 00:01:39,762
My goodness...

36
00:01:39,762 --> 00:01:43,299
His throat is so sore, he can't even speak.

37
00:01:43,299 --> 00:01:44,170
This looks serious.

38
00:01:44,170 --> 00:01:49,472
The doctor said it's just a common cold. He'll be better by tomorrow if he gets his rest and plenty of sleep.

39
00:01:49,472 --> 00:01:52,115
Jun... get well soon.

40
00:01:53,378 --> 00:01:54,567
Hmm.

41
00:01:54,567 --> 00:01:56,391
This is the perfect opportunity.

42
00:01:56,391 --> 00:01:59,146
The Metal Breath might as well already be in our hands!

43
00:01:59,146 --> 00:02:02,873
But... getting in way of gremlin prank means bad luck.

44
00:02:02,873 --> 00:02:05,921
Wait... don't tell me you actually believe in such superstitions?

45
00:02:05,921 --> 00:02:08,360
You foolish to not believe.

46
00:02:08,360 --> 00:02:10,457
So now you want to lecture me on who's foolish?

47
00:02:10,457 --> 00:02:12,835
No have to. We all know you are!

48
00:02:12,835 --> 00:02:16,663
Hey, hey! It doesn't matter if gremlins exist or not!

49
00:02:16,663 --> 00:02:21,129
If I were to lose the treasure sitting right before my very eye, I wouldn't deserve to be called Captain Black Hook.

50
00:02:21,129 --> 00:02:23,223
Black Crew, set sail!

51
00:02:23,223 --> 00:02:24,385
...It's not that way, though.

52
00:02:24,385 --> 00:02:25,502
Looks like Captain the fool.

53
00:02:25,502 --> 00:02:26,478
Quiet.

54
00:02:28,963 --> 00:02:31,469
Uh... Hey Theo.

55
00:02:31,469 --> 00:02:33,616
Don't you think this might be a little dangerous?

56
00:02:33,616 --> 00:02:34,805
What is?

57
00:02:34,805 --> 00:02:38,924
If Jun can't talk, that means... he can't use the Metal Breath to...

58
00:02:38,924 --> 00:02:41,236
Right! He can't summon the Cardbots!

59
00:02:41,236 --> 00:02:42,377
We need to hurry!

60
00:02:42,972 --> 00:02:44,574
Hey, wait for me, Anna!

61
00:02:46,219 --> 00:02:47,281
Jun has a cold?

62
00:02:47,281 --> 00:02:51,513
Help us, Fleta Z! You're the only one that can protect Jun right now!

63
00:02:51,513 --> 00:02:52,944
Of course I'll help you.

64
00:02:52,944 --> 00:02:53,800
Really?!

65
00:02:53,800 --> 00:02:57,959
Even if you say that, your engine is still sputtering out.

66
00:02:57,959 --> 00:03:03,497
Still... I cannot refuse a favor from such a charming and beautiful girl like Miss Anna.

67
00:03:03,997 --> 00:03:07,247
What they're after is Jun's Metal Breath!

68
00:03:07,247 --> 00:03:09,111
I have an idea.

69
00:03:09,111 --> 00:03:10,824
What are you going to do?

70
00:03:18,754 --> 00:03:21,295
We'll be arriving soon. Prepare yourselves!

71
00:03:35,243 --> 00:03:37,248
And just who are you two scallywags?

72
00:03:37,546 --> 00:03:39,390
Who are we, you ask?

73
00:03:42,670 --> 00:03:45,252
The sonic speed hero, Fleta Z!

74
00:03:45,252 --> 00:03:48,414
The guardian of peace, Anna!

75
00:03:48,414 --> 00:03:49,959
Together we are...

76
00:03:49,959 --> 00:03:51,622
Z and Anna! (FX-buffaloCrush bold xl)

77
00:03:51,622 --> 00:03:53,310
Foul pirates with your eyes on our treasure!

78
00:03:53,310 --> 00:03:55,329
We will send you...

79
00:03:55,329 --> 00:03:57,574
Back to space!!

80
00:03:57,574 --> 00:03:59,139
Wohohoho...

81
00:03:59,139 --> 00:04:00,873
We're not interested in either of you!

82
00:04:00,873 --> 00:04:03,308
We're here for the Metal Breath!

83
00:04:03,308 --> 00:04:04,479
Get out of my way!

84
00:04:04,479 --> 00:04:06,389
The Metal Breath?

85
00:04:06,389 --> 00:04:07,849
You mean this?

86
00:04:09,116 --> 00:04:10,150
No way!

87
00:04:10,150 --> 00:04:12,259
H-How do you have the treasure of Deus Machina?!

88
00:04:12,259 --> 00:04:16,314
If you thought Jun was the only one that could use the Metal Breath,

89
00:04:16,314 --> 00:04:17,331
you were sorely mistaken!

90
00:04:17,331 --> 00:04:20,875
Strange. Me no smell Deus Machina on that little human.

91
00:04:20,875 --> 00:04:22,276
That's impossible!

92
00:04:22,276 --> 00:04:24,687
Uh... yeah! Is your nose blocked or something?

93
00:04:24,687 --> 00:04:26,161
What?! Do you have a cold?!

94
00:04:26,161 --> 00:04:27,971
Me no catch colds!

95
00:04:27,971 --> 00:04:31,569
Anna! We need to get them away from Jun's house!

96
00:04:31,569 --> 00:04:32,963
I'm on it!

97
00:04:32,963 --> 00:04:35,663
Let's fly, Fleta Z!

98
00:04:36,278 --> 00:04:38,196
Let's go!

99
00:04:40,163 --> 00:04:41,790
You're not getting away!

100
00:04:48,204 --> 00:04:49,749
Shoot them down, Buster Gallon!

101
00:04:49,949 --> 00:04:51,302
Already on it!

102
00:04:54,716 --> 00:04:55,973
Are you okay?

103
00:04:55,973 --> 00:04:57,439
Y-yeah, don't worry-

104
00:04:58,937 --> 00:04:59,769
Hang on tight!

105
00:05:04,511 --> 00:05:05,716
Are you alright, Anna?!

106
00:05:05,716 --> 00:05:08,569
Yeah! I can handle this!-

107
00:05:09,125 --> 00:05:10,882
Are you sure you'll be okay?

108
00:05:10,882 --> 00:05:13,211
Fleta Z? What's going on?

109
00:05:13,211 --> 00:05:14,548
Don't worry. It's nothing.

110
00:05:14,548 --> 00:05:15,682
Aaah!

111
00:05:15,682 --> 00:05:17,913
Where are you? Fleta Z?!

112
00:05:23,468 --> 00:05:25,206
You little scoundrels!

113
00:05:25,206 --> 00:05:27,379
Try as you might, but your efforts are futile.

114
00:05:27,379 --> 00:05:28,211
Chest Cannon...

115
00:05:28,211 --> 00:05:29,194
Fire!

116
00:05:36,920 --> 00:05:38,409
Guided missiles?

117
00:05:38,409 --> 00:05:39,913
Anna. Hang on!

118
00:05:41,144 --> 00:05:42,613
Aaaah!

119
00:05:46,163 --> 00:05:49,000
Huh? Over there, little one is falling!

120
00:05:49,000 --> 00:05:50,288
He abandoned his master!

121
00:05:50,288 --> 00:05:51,560
Now's our chance, Black Hook!

122
00:05:51,560 --> 00:05:53,125
I told you to call me captain!

123
00:06:08,279 --> 00:06:09,410
Oh no...

124
00:06:09,410 --> 00:06:11,985
I don't think I can keep flying. Let's take this fight back to land.

125
00:06:12,362 --> 00:06:13,704
Waaah!

126
00:06:14,266 --> 00:06:16,649
It sounds like they are in battle.

127
00:06:16,649 --> 00:06:18,603
It must be Black Hook's gang!

128
00:06:18,603 --> 00:06:21,750
So... he's fighting the three of them by himself?

129
00:06:21,750 --> 00:06:24,870
What should we do? We can't help in our current state!

130
00:06:24,870 --> 00:06:25,887
Woah!

131
00:06:28,177 --> 00:06:30,447
Jun. Are you awake?

132
00:06:30,447 --> 00:06:31,596
Ugh...

133
00:06:35,554 --> 00:06:37,106
You did great out there.

134
00:06:37,106 --> 00:06:40,429
Fleta Z... You were great too...

135
00:06:40,429 --> 00:06:42,875
Are-are you sure you're alright?

136
00:06:44,432 --> 00:06:45,798
Over there!

137
00:06:49,680 --> 00:06:52,641
To think I'd get hit by my own Chest Cannon...

138
00:06:52,641 --> 00:06:55,370
I've got to hand it to you for making it this far!

139
00:06:55,370 --> 00:06:57,271
You not getting away this time!

140
00:06:57,271 --> 00:07:00,487
Now. Hand over the Metal Breath immediately.

141
00:07:00,487 --> 00:07:02,762
Oh my. This isn't good.

142
00:07:02,762 --> 00:07:05,875
No waste time! Hand it over!!

143
00:07:06,326 --> 00:07:08,947
Aah! Fleta Z, get down!

144
00:07:11,451 --> 00:07:12,488
Watch it!

145
00:07:12,488 --> 00:07:13,254
Sorry.

146
00:07:13,254 --> 00:07:15,286
Buster Blaster!

147
00:07:16,350 --> 00:07:17,163
Do a barrel roll!

148
00:07:20,459 --> 00:07:21,399
Oh no...

149
00:07:22,189 --> 00:07:25,678
Z and Anna Punch! (FX-buffaloCrush bold xl)

150
00:07:25,678 --> 00:07:28,156
Z and Anna... Punch!!

151
00:07:29,826 --> 00:07:33,963
Jun! I came home early today! Are you feeling any better?

152
00:07:33,963 --> 00:07:35,168
Huh? Jun?

153
00:07:39,348 --> 00:07:42,298
Yes! We did it!

154
00:07:42,298 --> 00:07:44,332
What a disgrace...

155
00:07:44,332 --> 00:07:47,415
I don't get it... why doesn't he use his bow?

156
00:07:47,415 --> 00:07:49,851
How do you like the power of Z and Anna-

157
00:07:49,851 --> 00:07:50,939
Oh...!

158
00:07:59,254 --> 00:08:02,483
Uhh...

159
00:08:04,309 --> 00:08:06,990
Metal Breath?

160
00:08:07,384 --> 00:08:09,492
WHAT?!

161
00:08:09,492 --> 00:08:10,718
It's fake!

162
00:08:10,718 --> 00:08:12,382
That little pipsqueak tricked us!

163
00:08:12,654 --> 00:08:15,120
You will not be forgiven!

164
00:08:15,889 --> 00:08:17,677
Oh no! Anna! Watch out!

165
00:08:17,677 --> 00:08:21,225
Captain's Cannon! Fire!

166
00:08:26,643 --> 00:08:28,538
Anna... are you alright?

167
00:08:28,538 --> 00:08:30,915
I... can't anymore...

168
00:08:30,915 --> 00:08:36,450
Playing the Black Hook Crew for a bunch of fools? I'll make you pay for that, and with interest!

171
00:08:36,450 --> 00:08:38,600
Brace yourselves!

172
00:08:38,600 --> 00:08:40,129
Spinning Cutter!

173
00:08:42,596 --> 00:08:43,533
What?

174
00:08:44,168 --> 00:08:46,334
Haha! Sorry to keep you waiting!

175
00:08:47,115 --> 00:08:48,509
Jun!

176
00:08:48,509 --> 00:08:50,559
It's the small fry!

177
00:08:50,559 --> 00:08:52,947
So is that the real Metal Breath this time?!

178
00:08:52,947 --> 00:08:57,297
But he can't even talk with a sore throat! How were they summoned?

179
00:08:57,297 --> 00:09:00,326
Jun and I are connected in spirit. We don't need words to communicate.

180
00:09:00,326 --> 00:09:01,299
Don't be ridiculous.

181
00:09:01,299 --> 00:09:02,732
Whatever the case may be,

182
00:09:02,732 --> 00:09:05,666
you delivered yourselves right to us, so I hope you came prepared!

183
00:09:05,666 --> 00:09:07,607
Now bring me the Metal Breath!

184
00:09:07,607 --> 00:09:08,899
I'm getting really tired of this!

185
00:09:10,477 --> 00:09:13,778
P-Phoenix Fire... setup...

186
00:09:19,528 --> 00:09:21,943
B...Burning... Hammer...

187
00:09:23,419 --> 00:09:26,246
Burning... Hammer!!

188
00:09:29,595 --> 00:09:31,399
Buffalo Moonsault!

189
00:09:35,923 --> 00:09:37,634
Forceps Shock...

190
00:09:39,649 --> 00:09:41,113
Forceps Shock!

191
00:09:46,164 --> 00:09:47,735
How is this... possible?!

192
00:09:47,735 --> 00:09:50,739
Is this just another one of your tricks?

193
00:09:50,739 --> 00:09:52,340
Fleta Z!

194
00:09:52,340 --> 00:09:55,424
I'm okay now. Please try to hear Jun's voice too!

195
00:09:55,424 --> 00:09:57,182
Jun's voice...?

196
00:09:57,182 --> 00:09:58,597
Ah! Right!

197
00:09:58,597 --> 00:10:00,678
Jun! I'm ready too!

198
00:10:01,509 --> 00:10:03,269
Fleta Z!

199
00:10:03,269 --> 00:10:06,166
The two of us will end the battle with Vulture Wings!

200
00:10:06,166 --> 00:10:06,513
Understood!

201
00:10:13,513 --> 00:10:15,061
End of the line for you!

202
00:10:15,193 --> 00:10:16,523
Black Hook!

203
00:10:19,866 --> 00:10:22,700
Vulture Wings!

204
00:10:23,895 --> 00:10:26,332
Vulture... Wings!

205
00:10:27,250 --> 00:10:29,105
Captain's Cannon!!

206
00:10:44,116 --> 00:10:46,860
You are going to pay for this!

207
00:10:50,792 --> 00:10:53,572
The Black Crew will never give up!

208
00:10:53,870 --> 00:10:56,919
Well you should learn when to give up!

209
00:10:58,211 --> 00:11:00,730
Jun! Are you alright?!

210
00:11:02,100 --> 00:11:03,964
Oh, Jun...

211
00:11:07,769 --> 00:11:10,240
T-Thanks, Anna... Fleta Z...

212
00:11:10,240 --> 00:11:12,578
It's my duty to protect you, Jun.

213
00:11:12,578 --> 00:11:15,360
I'm the one who should be saying thank you! You saved us!

214
00:11:16,447 --> 00:11:19,289
You're burning up! Let's get you home!

215
00:11:19,289 --> 00:11:21,961
I... can't go on!

216
00:11:22,485 --> 00:11:25,278
Hang in there! Jun!!

